<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/BaYj-2/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "भञ्ज् I /bhañj/ (U. pr. /bhañjayati/ /bhañja-yate/ — X- aor. /abhabhañjat/ /abhabhañja-ta/) 1) говорить 2) освещать (напр. вопрос)"@ru ;
