<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/BaYj-2/dict/koch/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "भञ्ज् II /bhañj/ (P. pr. /bhanakti/ — VII- jut. /bhaṅkṣyati/- pf. /babhdnja/- aor. /dbhdhksii/- pp. /bhagna/) 1) ломать- разрушать- разбивать 2) разочаровывать 3) обманывать"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/BaYj-2/dict/kna/3> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "भञ्ज्\t/bhañj/\t/bhaJj/\t/бхандж/\tbhañj (bhanakti, pp. bhagna) ломать, разбивать, уничтожать.\tс. 247"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
